        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga Israeli miidoobiiweadi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Israeli ea Yuda gagasa gwaduukuuna",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeeshiinean NG'UTAMIIDA aba damanda sugoocheanda was Yosiya: “Neada ea mii nidaahi gida sin Israeleeda mandeawana masaweega, gidabeada ea gawa uhuuda heayeeda geaw ea guumba giliwas geeta shabwaat, ak gwahiseada aba hoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geateemshi, ‘Iing'ata nea nisin ng'asheesu seaniin ak gaygabiigu heedeanyu’; ak ea mabiikna nea ghwadaah huda ghaamwat bea ng'uyeega was Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwadaah ng'asheega sean bea hiseadayeanduumeedeaba diita mandeawana masaweegean, Israeli neasiksi gawa sing'adayi; nea huda ghaamwat bea ng'uyeega ea mabeala, ak gawa ak gwahiseada eara niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghang'uda ng'eanyiida ririnnyeanda ak gamealuul aba badita aseecheeka sisna lagheanga ea geediga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba ng'asheesu seaniin huda ghaamwat was Yuda ea mabiiksean aba gurooroadaanyi sean, aba nyoota mureeda, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeeshiinean NG'UTAMIIDA, “Israeleeda mandeawana masaweega niihiimu gideaba giidiinyeandaanyi aamwanang' madeeneawana dea ng'uyeega Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi una, ak girukuti ng'asheesu nea gigali wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa nea giyeeshi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“‘Ak gaydagoonyi jeagiischoodiga gasa gurooroodeanyu, jea ghoahaaghwiidaneegwa fughareeda ea nalooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iyoahaadi ea asaang'ayiida aba jeeda ng'eanyiida, aba askwearjoojigiga, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ea maygudu ayeena, “Sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA.” Ak ea maygudu eapkaat, ghana eejeeng'u, ghana ghwaroat; ak ea maygudu eebiikta eesin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Yerusalemu gajeeguura hoorgeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gaygabassa geat eemoojiga sean jeeda, aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA aba Yerusalemu, ak ea maygudugabiikta ghoahang'waay iheenga nea gamaseaw ng'asheega munyas bea gurooruunatka nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aba eawoojigiga fuga Yuda gaygaguuyi sea fuga Israeli, ak gaygoodeanyi duwaawi nea gwaleabu ng'eanyiida mida wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa ea ghwahidu ng'eanyiida aadawji ghweaniga nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga ASEETA ghabwat sanaamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea gidang'eada gheareemaneanduumeedeanya nilas uhuudeanya baspaseega eesa sean was dea ghayi sin ghweanigaasa, was nooga nyaawa sea hawaniga nyaawa bea dugwa, ea orjooga nyaawa ea haweega nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gagasa eabwadana jeesinga ng'eanyi aba baspaseegaasa, nea gwadukutaneasa nyooteanya bea mureeda; aba gideaba sisinyi riing'eeda aba badayda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA, aseasa ea ghweanigaasa, ghang'eada gheareemaneanduumeedeanya ak ea meesisiini mureeda asi eara aseasa ea miyeesisiina mureeda ghuuta NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
